{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2015-03", "window": 4, "start_date": 1427155200, "end_date": 1427846399, "month_true_total": 41, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:50:24 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "15139396", "author": {"steamid": "76561198047269124", "personaname": "Cupcakeunleashed", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198047269124/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 134, "playtime_forever": 3132, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1143, "last_played": 1717333096, "avatar": "91c9c83a15d182221867bf7153f6ad7f39855ec8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Used to play on xbox.\nBut now, two years after leaving my xbox...\nThis game is still so ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ good.\n\nTis sad to say that since THQ shut down, SM still has server issues and could use more content, but what it currently has is just soo good, that it doesn't matter.\n\nCampaign is ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ amazing.\nMultiplayer is badass.\nThere is no reason why you shouldn't have played this game.", "timestamp_created": 1427803307, "timestamp_updated": 1427803307, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.529703021049499512", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "15138283", "author": {"steamid": "76561198055339463", "personaname": "Voidbaby", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198055339463/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 1676, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 843, "last_played": 1519515243, "avatar": "9c187db0783dffaf83f3ddbbb9ac1b1236ac2162"}, "language": "english", "review": " if you like killing orks, killing deamonds and running around as a proud a space marine BUY THIS GAME!!!!! 9/10\n                                                                                      \n", "timestamp_created": 1427796977, "timestamp_updated": 1427796977, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.527559041976928711", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "15131915", "author": {"steamid": "76561198037178643", "personaname": "Juicebox", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Azill123/", "num_games_owned": 170, "num_reviews": 44, "playtime_forever": 512, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 375, "last_played": 1539898862, "avatar": "cdd06919bfa3e01ca1176018f0d716c52fbabb73"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fast paced gameplay that stagnates as the game goes on, insane difficulty curves, poor writing and a predictable plot, and the game ends with a QTE boss battle, after all the build up to an epic battle it ends with a QTE. Also, the game is only about 6 hours long. I would only recommend this game if you happen to see it on sale for very cheap. If this were not a warhammer game, it would have been torn apart by fans and critics.", "timestamp_created": 1427754593, "timestamp_updated": 1427754593, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 16, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.512683570384979248", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "15131315", "author": {"steamid": "76561198117940206", "personaname": "Capo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/incirli/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 379, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 114, "last_played": 1431976875, "avatar": "c6f3f9fee9190c07d6e8f6a905005d8328ddee41"}, "language": "english", "review": "SO FLIPPIN AMAZING! this game is so fun, there isnt any cutting corners, very straight forward and the graphics are amazing. the fun part of it, is that the AI Orks are so talented that they actually TRY to kill you. 5/5", "timestamp_created": 1427751709, "timestamp_updated": 1427751709, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "15130103", "author": {"steamid": "76561198036158821", "personaname": "Alcazar", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198036158821/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 2592, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1805, "last_played": 1761129016, "avatar": "9c051baadb5240367960752c3c92b0aabfb2f236"}, "language": "english", "review": "The only thing wrong with this game is the lack of a sequal.\n\nSeriously, at long last, a W40K FPS and it was done RIGHT!\n\nYes, I know, Space Marines don't come with Master-Chief-esque shields that recharge when you avoid damage for a time.  It's a necessary evil for the game design.\n\nBut the very fact that simply walking down a corridor yields a hefty 'thunk thunk' as your armor-shod feet crush the ground beneath you...just amazing.\n\nIf I have to levy a criticism, it would be:  WHERE IS MY FLAMER?!?!\n\nAs a long time W40K fan, I can say you won't be disappointed with this game.", "timestamp_created": 1427745938, "timestamp_updated": 1427745938, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}